# Netlify _redirects - Subdomain configuration
# Deploy this file alongside your site on Netlify/Vercel/Cloudflare Pages
# https://admin.palengkehub.site/* -> serves from /admin-login.html and /admin.html

# This file tells the hosting platform how to handle the admin subdomain.
# For Netlify: deploy both palengkehub.site and admin.palengkehub.site pointing to the same site.
# For Vercel: use a separate project for admin subdomain, or set up rewrites.
# For Cloudflare Pages: create a separate project or use Functions.

# DNS Setup Required:
# Add a CNAME record: admin.palengkehub.site -> your-hosting-url
# OR add an A record: admin.palengkehub.site -> your-server-ip